[{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0141","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0141.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2821","title":"Google Chrome libxml2 双重释放远程拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Google Chrome 浏览器所依赖的 libxml2 库中存在双重释放漏洞（CWE-415）。当浏览器解析包含特制 XPath 表达式的网页内容时，libxml2 组件对 XML 数据的处理过程中出现内存管理错误，导致同一块内存被多次释放。远程攻击者无需任何身份认证，只需向目标用户发送一个包含恶意构建 XPath 表达式的网页链接，诱使用户使用受影响版本的 Google Chrome 浏览器访问该页面，即可触发此漏洞。成功利用后可能导致应用程序崩溃（拒绝服务），在特定条件下还可能实现任意代码执行，完全控制用户系统。该漏洞影响 Google Chrome 13.0.782.215 之前的所有版本，同时影响苹果 iOS 6.0 之前版本、Mac OS X 10.7.4 之前版本以及 Debian Linux、Red Hat Enterprise Linux 等主流操作系统。CVSS v2 评分为 7.5（高危），网络攻击向量、低攻击复杂度、无需认证即可利用，对机密性、完整性和可用性均可能造成严重影响。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2821"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-08-29T15:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:03Z","remediation":"立即升级 Google Chrome 浏览器至 13.0.782.215 或更高版本，该版本修复了 libxml2 库中的双重释放漏洞。如无法立即更新，可禁用浏览器中的 JavaScript 执行作为临时缓解措施，因为该漏洞需要通过构造的 XPath 表达式触发。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://code.google.com/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=89402","http://googlechromereleases.blogspot.com/2011/08/stable-channel-update_22.html","http://h20000.www2.hp.com/bizsupport/TechSupport/Document.jsp?objectID=c03360041","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/May/msg00001.html","http://lists.apple.com/archives/security-announce/2012/Sep/msg00003.html","http://rhn.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2013-0217.html","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5281","http://support.apple.com/kb/HT5503","http://www.debian.org/security/2012/dsa-2394","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2011:145","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-1749.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A13840","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4b8a931e66205de38efd28d6bcd5a334776dbc3a/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2821.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2821","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2821","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c6571763508e950910be0b6238faf54b18800390/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2821.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-2821","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/1f7c9527c0f5bb4cce2670b0d21c4073607d138e/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-2821","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/374ee5fd4c3d4b67a06356f81fc4dfb1acd1d842/2011/CVE-2011-2821.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2821.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/add906b6a8ba20fd533c6fdd7f023c73e6090f3a/nvdcve/CVE-2011-2821.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-2821"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0141.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0169","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0169.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2993","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey 未签名脚本安全绕过漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox 4.x 至 5 版本及 SeaMonkey 2.x（2.3 之前）在处理 JAR 文件数字签名时存在实现缺陷，未能有效防止未签名的 JavaScript 代码调用已签名的代码。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问精心构造的恶意网站，利用此缺陷绕过同源策略（SOP），使其未签名脚本能够继承已签名 JAR 文件的权限和身份，从而实现特权提升并窃取敏感数据。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 9.3，危害等级为严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2993"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-08-18T18:55:02Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:23Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Mozilla Firefox 升级至 6.0 或更高版本，SeaMonkey 升级至 2.3 或更高版本。对于无法立即升级的系统，建议禁用不必要的第三方插件，并避免访问来源不明的恶意网页以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-08/msg00023.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-29.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-33.html","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=657267","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14055","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2993.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2993","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2993","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-2993","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/e701323a68aa022329783fc6fbcb51c8037899bc/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2993.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/1f7c9527c0f5bb4cce2670b0d21c4073607d138e/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-2993","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2993.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-2993","https://github.com/pombredanne/git.launchpad.net-ubuntu-cve-tracker-/blob/fcedabe073a8eb8b2e85c436aeec152320c7cde3/retired/CVE-2011-2993","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/f4ac1c4571cf4619eb3fd2e729b251b1c03b9450/tracker/CVE/2011/CVE-2011-2993.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0169.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0168","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0168.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2992","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird 浏览器引擎远程代码执行漏洞","description":"标签之间。<value>Mozilla Firefox 4.x 至 5.x、SeaMonkey 2.x 早于 2.3 版本以及 Thunderbird 6.0 之前版本的浏览器引擎中，Ogg 格式读取器存在内存安全漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制构造的 Ogg 媒体文件触发该漏洞，导致内存损坏，进而引发应用程序崩溃（拒绝服务）或可能执行任意代码。该漏洞无需身份验证即可从远程利用，攻击条件简单，危害等级达到 CVSS 满分 10.0。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2992"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-08-18T18:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:23Z","remediation":"立即将 Mozilla Firefox 升级至 6.0 或更高版本（SeaMonkey 升级至 2.3，Thunderbird 升级至 6.0），该补丁修复了 Ogg 读取器中的内存破坏漏洞。如暂时无法升级，可在浏览器设置中禁用媒体自动播放功能或关闭 Ogg/Vorbis 格式支持作为临时缓解措施，同时启用操作系统 DEP 数据执行防护以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-08/msg00023.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/49055","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-29.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-31.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-33.html","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=672789","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14209","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e75ae6c145bf0fa550455c4b2b7c9e0f03c663af/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2992.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2992","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2992","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-2992","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/1f7c9527c0f5bb4cce2670b0d21c4073607d138e/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-2992","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/13b4b6847c146245cb34369c97e37afd6dfad908/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2992.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2992.json","https://github.com/pombredanne/git.launchpad.net-ubuntu-cve-tracker-/blob/fcedabe073a8eb8b2e85c436aeec152320c7cde3/retired/CVE-2011-2992","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-2992","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/f4ac1c4571cf4619eb3fd2e729b251b1c03b9450/tracker/CVE/2011/CVE-2011-2992.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0168.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0167","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0167.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2991","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Mozilla 浏览器引擎在实现 JavaScript 时存在内存安全漏洞，导致内存破坏。远程攻击者可通过诱导用户访问特制的恶意网页或加载特制内容，利用该漏洞触发应用程序崩溃（拒绝服务），或在特定条件下实现远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Mozilla Firefox 4.x 至 5 版本、Thunderbird 6.0 之前版本以及 SeaMonkey 2.x（2.3 之前）版本。攻击条件为受害者加载由攻击者控制的恶意脚本或内容。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2991"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-08-18T18:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:23Z","remediation":"将 Firefox 升级到 6.0 或更高版本、SeaMonkey 升级到 2.3 或更高版本、Thunderbird 升级到 6.0 或更高版本，浏览器引擎的 JavaScript 崩溃漏洞即可得到修复。如短期内无法升级，可在 Firefox 中通过 about:config 禁用 JavaScript（将 javascript.enabled 设为 false）作为临时缓解措施，或在邮件客户端中关闭 HTML 邮件和远程内容自动加载功能，以降低网页或邮件中的恶意 JavaScript 引发崩溃的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-08/msg00023.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/49055","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-29.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-31.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-33.html","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=655660","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14303","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/e7eb023b782298741349c34d7e1f5ea1ecb3d73d/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2991.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2991","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2991","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/