2026-06-16T23:32:22Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Mozilla Thunderbird 升级至 6.0 或更高版本，Firefox 升级至 6.0 或更高版本，以及 SeaMonkey 升级至 2.3 或更高版本，以修复浏览器引擎中的内存安全漏洞并防止远程代码执行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-08/msg00023.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/49055","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-29.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-31.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-33.html","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=674042","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14528","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2011/CVE-2011-2989.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0da25b98d7bcc33832f1568bdeed8ba3a55a37d8/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2989.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2011/CVE-2011-2989.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2011/CVE-2011-2989.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2989","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2989","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-2989","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2011/CVE-2011-2989.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/1f7c9527c0f5bb4cce2670b0d21c4073607d138e/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-2989","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/12510680d47d531059ad635931375e3cc99ef556/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2989.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0165.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0164","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0164.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2988","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird WebGL着色器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox、Thunderbird 及 SeaMonkey 的 WebGL 着色器实现中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标发送包含超长着色器源代码块的恶意网页，触发 WebGL 字符串类的缓冲区溢出，导致应用程序崩溃或远程任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 Firefox 4.x 至 5.x、Thunderbird 6.0 之前版本以及 SeaMonkey 2.x 2.3 之前版本，CVSS v3 评分高达 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击者无需身份验证，仅需诱导受害者在浏览器中访问恶意页面即可利用此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2988"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-08-18T18:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:22Z","remediation":"立即升级 Firefox 至 6.0 或更高版本。Firefox 4.x 至 5.x 版本中的 WebGL 着色器实现存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者通过构造超长的 shader 程序源代码可导致应用程序崩溃或执行任意代码。如暂时无法升级，可通过在浏览器地址栏输入 about:config 并设置 webgl.disabled 为 true 来禁用 WebGL 功能作为临时缓解措施。Thunderbird 用户应升级至 6.0 或更高版本，SeaMonkey 用户应升级至 2.3 或更高版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-08/msg00023.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/49055","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-29.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-31.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-33.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/49242","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=665936","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14270","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2011/CVE-2011-2988.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1ac98a91d8e5706025fef27b7d1430b2ff35075a/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2988.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2011/CVE-2011-2988.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2011/CVE-2011-2988.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2988","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2988","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-2988","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2011/CVE-2011-2988.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/199b0137f80e0b8f3076e0f504b47ff2468fdac5/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2988.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/1f7c9527c0f5bb4cce2670b0d21c4073607d138e/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-2988"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2011/POC-AVE-2011-0164.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2011/EXP-AVE-2011-0164.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0164.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0163","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0163.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2987","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird ANGLE库堆溢出漏洞","description":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird 等产品中的 ANGLE（Almost Native Graphics Layer Engine）库存在堆溢出漏洞，该漏洞位于 WebGL 实现中。攻击者可通过发送特制的 WebGL 着色器程序或利用浏览器引擎中的未指定向量触发堆溢出，无需身份认证即可在目标系统上远程执行任意代码。影响范围包括 Firefox 4.x 至 5 版本、Thunderbird 6.0 之前版本、SeaMonkey 2.x 2.3 之前版本及其他可能使用 ANGLE 库的产品，CVSS 评分 10，危害等级极高。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2987"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-08-18T18:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:22Z","remediation":"立即升级至 Firefox 7、Thunderbird 7 或 SeaMonkey 2.4 版本以修复 ANGLE 库堆溢出漏洞。升级方法：打开浏览器或邮件客户端，进入设置菜单选择「关于」或「帮助→关于」，系统将自动检查并安装最新版本。如暂时无法升级，可在浏览器设置中禁用 WebGL 功能（about:config 中将 webgl.disabled 设为 true）以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-08/msg00023.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/49055","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-29.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-31.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-33.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/49226","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=665934","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14285","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2011/CVE-2011-2987.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/cd696685415f2042291d9e0384b081621f3c1f4b/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2987.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2011/CVE-2011-2987.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2011/CVE-2011-2987.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2987","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2987","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-2987","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2011/CVE-2011-2987.md","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/1f7c9527c0f5bb4cce2670b0d21c4073607d138e/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-2987","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/ef75ce172dfcb1356ff39d845afc3279616b6768/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2987.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2011/AVE-2011-0163.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2011-0162","file_name":"2011/AVE-2011-0162.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2011-2986","title":"Mozilla Firefox/Thunderbird/SeaMonkey 跨源数据窃取漏洞","description":"该漏洞存在于 Mozilla Firefox 4.x 至 5 版本、Thunderbird 6.0 之前版本以及 SeaMonkey 2.x 之前版本中。当这些浏览器在 Windows 系统上使用 Direct2D (D2D) API 进行硬件加速时，其 canvas 元素处理机制存在缺陷，允许远程攻击者绕过同源策略（Same Origin Policy）。攻击者可以通过在 canvas 中插入恶意内容，非法获取来自不同域名的敏感图像数据。利用该漏洞需要用户访问受控的恶意网页，从而导致跨源数据窃取。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2986"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-08-18T18:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:32:22Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Mozilla Firefox 升级至 6.0 或更高版本，Mozilla Thunderbird 升级至 6.0 或更高版本，以及 SeaMonkey 升级至 2.3 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可通过在浏览器设置中禁用硬件加速（Direct2D）来缓解该跨源数据窃取风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-08/msg00023.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/49055","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-29.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-31.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-33.html","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=655836","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14497","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ab00a662168d29727ed07327ed7248857f064d23/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2986.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2986","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2986","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-2986","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/1f7c9527c0f5bb4cce2670b0d21c4073607d138e/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-2986","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/15f9f7a0b2cc2a296dac75e46487bfa653db3e1b/CVE/data/2011/CVE-2011-2986.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2011/CVE-2011-2986.json","https://github.com/eslerm/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/f17e5ebf7a87347cc68d8fae347d07409a857342/retired/CVE-2011-2986","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/464c797de515f2d88fce07a24f8ad97207296c93/tracker/CVE/2011/CVE-2011-2986.json","https://github.