12 之前版本及 6 之前版本、SeaMonkey 2.3 之前版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。Mozilla 已在 2011 年 8 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-0084"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-08-18T18:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:26:46Z","remediation":"立即升级 Firefox 至 3.6.20 及以上版本（4.x/5 系列用户升级至 6.0），Thunderbird 升级至 3.1.12 及以上版本，SeaMonkey 升级至 2.3 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在浏览器中禁用 JavaScript 作为临时缓解措施（about:config 中设置 javascript.enabled=false）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-08/msg00023.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-08/msg00027.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2295","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2296","http://www.debian.org/security/2011/dsa-2297","http://www.mandriva.com/security/advisories?name=MDVSA-2011:127","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-29.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-30.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-31.html","http://www.mozilla.org/security/announce/2011/mfsa2011-33.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-1164.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-1166.html","https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=648094","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14502","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2011/CVE-2011-0084.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2786c0581d3fd3239f3f8ab3739b9b784dba4433/cves/2011/0xxx/CVE-2011-0084.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-0084","https://github.com/mozilla/foundation-security-advisories/blob/3b3c634b70342ed22f06614c696b3ad8867239e1/announce/2011/mfsa2011-32.md","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-0084","https: