者通过构造特制的 Flash 内容，诱使用户访问恶意网页或打开恶意文件，触发内存损坏，导致远程代码执行或拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Windows、Mac OS X、Linux、Solaris 及 Android 平台上的 Flash Player 10.3.183.5 之前版本及 AIR 2.7.1 之前版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。Adobe 已在 2011 年 8 月安全公告中发布更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2011-2425"],"sources":["tenable"],"published":"2011-08-10T22:55:01Z","updated":"2026-06-16T23:31:18Z","remediation":"立即升级 Adobe Flash Player 至 10.3.183.5 及以上版本（Windows/Mac/Linux/Solaris）或 10.3.186.3 及以上版本（Android），同时升级 Adobe AIR 至 2.7.1 及以上版本。由于 Adobe Flash Player 已于 2020 年底停止支持，建议彻底卸载 Flash Player 并迁移至 HTML5 技术栈；如业务必须使用，可在浏览器中启用 click-to-play 机制并限制仅访问可信站点。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-08/msg00006.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-08/msg00007.html","http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2011-08/msg00008.html","http://secunia.com/advisories/48308","http://www.adobe.com/support/security/bulletins/apsb11-21.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2011-1144.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/49085","http://www.us-cert.gov/cas/techalerts/TA11-222A.html","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A14073","https://oval.cisecurity.org/repository/search/definition/oval%3Aorg.mitre.oval%3Adef%3A15475","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/95e02b73a69df169404c6b2708e1f8d0346744bc/cves/2011/2xxx/CVE-2011-2425.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2011/CVE-2011-2425","https://github.com/nottrobin/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/36e411296b5707284049ec2e0db8d2622feca498/retired/CVE-2011-2425","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2011-2425","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/ada0c6c45d02a82e11f6f46403716f0946c37f98/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2011-2425","https://github.com/Pat